WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.448
Step 1. Open the dispense order.

1.2
00:00:02.448 --> 00:00:07.669
Here you cancel an order with Mark as Abandoned or Mark as entered in error.

1.3
00:00:07.669 --> 00:00:13.183
Care cancels all its dispenses and puts their quantities back into stock.

2.1
00:00:13.183 --> 00:00:15.744
Step 2. Cancel an issued invoice.

2.2
00:00:15.744 --> 00:00:20.645
Care does not let you cancel the order while it has an issued invoice.

2.3
00:00:20.645 --> 00:00:29.243
Open the menu on the payment banner, select Cancel Invoice, then Confirm.

3.1
00:00:29.243 --> 00:00:32.121
Step 3. Select how to cancel the order.

3.2
00:00:32.121 --> 00:00:35.289
At the bottom of the page, select More Actions.

3.3
00:00:35.289 --> 00:00:40.641
Select Mark as Abandoned when the order stopped before it was completed.

4.1
00:00:40.641 --> 00:00:46.004
Step 4. Confirm. Care says that you cannot undo this. Select Confirm.

4.2
00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:51.914
The order shows the status Abandoned, and its dispenses become Cancelled.
